# Everything this directory produces is production exercise text. The repo is public.
#
# Only the scripts, the SQL, this file, the README and `fixtures/` (synthetic, written by hand)
# belong in git. `doc/core/tsl-migration/.gitignore` is the same rule for the same reason.
#
# The README tells you to export to /tmp, which is outside the repo — but "outside the repo" is a
# habit and this is a rule, and the two failure modes are not symmetrical: forgetting the habit
# publishes a thousand exercises.
*.jsonl
!fixtures/*.adoc
out/
work/
flagged/
payload.jsonl
receipt.txt
